docs\api_reference.md:359:| `WenzCollaborationAdapter` | App-owned collaboration backend bridge. Implementations publish local document changes / local selection and expose remote document / remote selection streams. |
docs\api_reference.md:360:| `WenzCollaborationController` | Optional sidecar controller that observes `WenzRichTextController` via `addListener`, publishes local mutations, applies remote document snapshots without echo, and exposes remote selections for renderer layers. |
docs\api_reference.md:361:| `WenzLocalDocumentChange` | Local change event containing `clientId`, current `RichTextDocument`, rich JSON snapshot, local revision, change time, selection, and `changedBlockIds`. |
docs\api_reference.md:362:| `WenzRemoteDocumentUpdate` | Backend-resolved remote document snapshot with optional transformed local selection and history-clear policy. |
docs\api_reference.md:363:| `WenzRemoteSelectionUpdate` | Ephemeral remote cursor/selection or clear event. It round-trips JSON for transport payloads and reports `isCursor` / `isClear`. |
