docs\progress\logs\20260624-220759_gen-feedback-1.log:369:I need to include specific scenarios for testing. First, a single click should place the caret before or after the inline embed, allowing normal selection. For acceptance criteria, when dragging from text to an emoji, the selection should include the emoji. It’s also important that dragging starts or ends on an emoji maps to boundaries. Shift+arrow across inline embeds should extend the selection. I need to consider whether copying content includes the serialization of emojis or mentions. Additionally, I should note optional risks and confirm the directory exists before applying patches.
